// 2011's Random event gift (2011 wiki, Random event gift: released with the
// random event update of 25 February 2009): a solved random event gives a
// gift, and opening it offers a choice of rewards, one per category. A row per
// reward the wiki lists: its category (`slot`, the inventory slot the client
// labels by category, cache-786 enum 2238) and the range of how many it
// offers. A members obj is offered on members worlds only (oc_members).
[random_event_gift]
column=slot,int,INDEXED,REQUIRED
column=reward,namedobj,REQUIRED
column=min,int,REQUIRED
column=max,int,REQUIRED
